~ start
Plush: Woah, such a wonderful day to exist in a killing game!
=> menu

~ menu
Plush: So? Where are you hopping today?
- Start a New Session (C Version)
	Plush: Off you go, then. Try not to die too early.
	do start_game()
- Start a Brand New Session (A Version)
	Plush: ... if you say so.
	do start_a_version()
- Load an Ongoing Session
	if SaveSystem.has_any()
		Plush: Oooh! So you left some notes behind... which page?
		- Slot 1: {{SaveSystem.describe(1)}} [if SaveSystem.has_slot(1) /]
			do load_game(1)
		- Slot 2: {{SaveSystem.describe(2)}} [if SaveSystem.has_slot(2) /]
			do load_game(2)
		- Slot 3: {{SaveSystem.describe(3)}} [if SaveSystem.has_slot(3) /]
			do load_game(3)
	else
		Plush: Hmm, it seems you haven't left anything to come back to.
		=> menu
- Session Participants
	Plush: It seems there is no one you know. Aww, you're all alone, aren'tcha? Well, worry not! Start a session and you'll find a plenty of company! One way or another...
	=> menu
- Session Settings
	Plush: We're hard at work, bud. With blood, [wave]sweet[/wave] and tears! Anyways, come back later.
	=> menu
- Quit Session
	Plush: [wave]Cya~[wave] [next=auto]
	do quit_game()
- Never Mind
	Plush: Suit Yourself, mhehe.
	=> END